<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit sets $500 mln seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit sets $500 mln seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    24.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.361   PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.786    SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/DE/NA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.3	 SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
